  "description": "Timberjack XT 29 is a 29er hardtail mountain bike with many possibilities. Its aluminum frame features our trail geometry, which positions you for greatness on descents and technical features without any big sacrifices in climbing ability. The 130 mm RockShox 35 Gold RL fork grants comfort and control over rocky, rooty trails, and the 29\" wheels maintain their momentum when rolling over obstacles. Thoughtful on-bike storage and versatile Alternator 2.0 dropouts let you configure your Timberjack for speedy trail sessions or stable bikepacking journeys. Shimano’s XT 1 x 12 componentry seals the deal with performance, reliability, and a wide gear range.",
